    "detailed_description": "<h1>Our games you might like</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1145660/extras/d765171bd0a198d770de9103e9d2cde6.avif?t=1733541595\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1145660/extras/b3c8b0f5980f2b1a4f05bcd6ec1f5def.avif?t=1733541595\" /></div><br><br><strong>In DOTH you will have to master the art of drifting in the mountain passes!</strong><br><br>Drift Of The Hill is a simulation game that will allow you to play as a driver in legendary cars on narrow and winding roads. Go down the hills by drifting, to music that will make you want to press the accelerator.<br><br><strong><i>&quot;Fill'er up. High octane&quot;</i></strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1145660/extras/2c498621e682c89c05a656ca23da3eea.webp?t=1733541595\" /></div><br><br><strong><i>Features :</i></strong><br><br>\u25a0 More than 3 different cars!<br>\u25a0 5 different maps!<br>\u25a0 Addictive drift system!<br>\u25a0 Realistic physics!<br>\u25a0 Detailed interior view!<br>\u25a0 Car characteristics are editable!<br>\u25a0 Replay system!<br>\u25a0 Day / night cycle!<br>\u25a0 Different climates!<br>\u25a0 Can be played with a controller!<br>\u25a0 Touge!<br>\u25a0 Eurobeat !",
